{"1466650": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tasty Arena", "steam_appid": 1466650, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1466650/extras/207cb91c0e5d731830227c76ceb59be5.avif?t=1758490063\" width=512 height=409 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your arsenal from a wide range of unique weapons and battle through diverse worlds to become the ultimate arena champion.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face waves of enemies as you push toward the final boss.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and uncover the hidden secrets the arenas have to offer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become stronger, loot, upgrade your arsenal, and rule the arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New game modes coming soon!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1466650/extras/370a61382ab1ebe959dd32dcd29a44cc.poster.avif?t=1758490063\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1466650/extras/370a61382ab1ebe959dd32dcd29a44cc.webm?t=1758490063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1466650/extras/370a61382ab1ebe959dd32dcd29a44cc.mp4?t=1758490063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Content</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Over 20 unique weapons to unlock… and this is just the beginning!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a horde of wacky and delicious enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic battles with dangerous bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 4 original worlds, each packed with surprises. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlockable weapons</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock a full arsenal!</strong><br>Discover new weapons by completing challenges or exploring the arena. Each unlocked weapon can be chosen in your loadout before every match.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the special weapons!</strong><br>Some weapons are incredibly powerful but have limited ammo. Use them wisely to dominate the arena.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1466650/extras/3e76dce15856b6a57c3ad5e9efa05857.poster.avif?t=1758490063\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1466650/extras/3e76dce15856b6a57c3ad5e9efa05857.webm?t=1758490063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1466650/extras/3e76dce15856b6a57c3ad5e9efa05857.mp4?t=1758490063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dangerous enemies!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A multitude of enemies to face!</strong><br>Encounter unique creatures, each with their own abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Some are more dangerous than others…</strong><br>Learn their patterns, adapt, and use your weapons to triumph.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Diverse destinations</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a variety of worlds!</str